  "visual_check": "Packaged browser: lobby to practice, choose pistol and rifle, fire, reload, move/crouch/strafe; inspect exported character and muzzle feedback. Real internet and 32-player load are distinct deployment proofs.",
  "system_delta": {
    "decision": "MERGE",
